          'site.fp.jobs.ans1': 'Yes. Technicians see the jobs given to them. Owners and managers see every job, can filter by technician or status, and search by customer or address.',
          'site.fp.jobs.ans2': 'Yes, until the technician starts it. After that the job stays with that technician, so all its proof comes from one person.',
          'site.fp.jobs.ans3': 'Yes. A technician can start a quick job on site — for example when the customer asks for one more unit to be checked.',
          'site.fp.jobs.ans4': 'No. Customers get the report as a secure link or a PDF. Only your team uses the app.',
          'site.fp.jobs.app_body': 'Create → assign → work → review. Everyone sees the same job.',
