          'site.fp.offline.ans1': 'No. Each item has its own tag, so even if the signal drops in the middle of sending, the server keeps only one copy.',
          'site.fp.offline.ans2': 'Your work is still there. The queue is kept on the phone and continues when the app opens again.',
          'site.fp.offline.ans3': 'Yes. The recording is saved on the phone and written down after it is sent.',
          'site.fp.offline.ans4': 'Yes, including @free. Nothing to switch on.',
          'site.fp.offline.app_body': 'Offline → capture → queue → sent. Nothing lost, nothing doubled.',
          'site.fp.offline.app_title': 'A job with no signal',
          'site.fp.offline.body': 'Rooftops, basements and plant rooms rarely have signal. KaamNishaan saves every photo, answer and voice note on the phone, keeps it safe in a queue and sends it when you’re back online — nothing lost, nothing sent twice.',
          'site.fp.offline.c1': 'Keep working on the job',
          'site.fp.offline.c1_b': 'Photos, checklist answers, voice notes and typed notes all work with no connection.',
          'site.fp.offline.c2': 'Automatic sending',
          'site.fp.offline.c2_b': 'When signal returns, everything is sent in the background.',
          'site.fp.offline.c3': 'Nothing sent twice',
          'site.fp.offline.c3_b': 'Each photo and answer has its own tag, so it is saved once even if the signal drops mid-send.',
          'site.fp.offline.c4': 'See what’s waiting',
          'site.fp.offline.c4_b': 'Items still on the phone show “Saved on phone”, so you know what hasn’t been sent yet.',
          'site.fp.offline.c5': 'Safe if the app closes',
          'site.fp.offline.c5_b': 'The queue is kept in the app’s storage, so it survives a restart.',
          'site.fp.offline.c6': 'Easy on mobile data',
          'site.fp.offline.c6_b': 'Photos are made smaller on the phone before they are sent.',
          'site.fp.offline.cap_body': 'No more lost photos or half-sent reports.',
