          'site.fp.ov.ans1': 'No. Every plan includes every feature, so use only what your team needs. Most teams start with jobs, photos and checklists, then add AI reports.',
          'site.fp.ov.ans2': 'Not the features. Plans differ in how many technicians you can add, reports a month, AI questions a month and follow-up credits. See the pricing page for the numbers.',
